        "action": "Fund stronger enforcement of the ban on fox hunting",
        "additional_details": "We want the Government to fund more effective enforcement of the law banning fox hunting.",
        "background": "Fox hunting in the UK is banned by law but we believe this ban is not being effectively implemented. We have seen reports on social media of foxes being killed over the last week by numerous hunts around the country.",
